### ===== 고객 Product API =====

### 상품 목록 조회 (기본)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products

### 상품 목록 조회 (페이지네이션 + 정렬)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products?page=0&size=10&sort=LATEST

### 상품 목록 조회 (가격 오름차순)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products?sort=PRICE_ASC

### 상품 목록 조회 (브랜드 필터)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products?brandId=1

### 상품 상세 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/1

### ===== 어드민 Product API =====

### 상품 등록
POST http://localhost:8080/api-admin/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-Ldap: loopers.admin

{
  "brandId": 1,
  "name": "에어맥스 90",
  "description": "나이키 에어맥스 90 클래식",
  "basePrice": 159000,
  "quantity": 100
}

### 상품 목록 조회 (페이지네이션)
GET http://localhost:8080/api-admin/v1/products?page=0&size=20
X-Loopers-Ldap: loopers.admin

### 상품 목록 조회 (브랜드 필터)
GET http://localhost:8080/api-admin/v1/products?brandId=1
X-Loopers-Ldap: loopers.admin

### 상품 상세 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api-admin/v1/products/1
X-Loopers-Ldap: loopers.admin

### 상품 수정
PUT http://localhost:8080/api-admin/v1/products/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-Ldap: loopers.admin

{
  "name": "에어맥스 95",
  "description": "나이키 에어맥스 95 리뉴얼",
  "basePrice": 179000
}

### 상품 상태 변경 (SOLDOUT)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api-admin/v1/products/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-Ldap: loopers.admin

{
  "status": "SOLDOUT"
}

### 상품 상태 변경 (HIDDEN)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api-admin/v1/products/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-Ldap: loopers.admin

{
  "status": "HIDDEN"
}

### 상품 삭제 (소프트 삭제 + 재고 연쇄 삭제)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api-admin/v1/products/1
X-Loopers-Ldap: loopers.admin
